   "postDate": "2026-08-06T20:26:54.100Z",
   "rawMarkdown": "The Data page describes train.csv as containing StudyInstanceUID, PatientSex and Report alongside the twelve labels. The file itself has 14 columns: StudyInstanceUID, Report, and the 12 labels. There is no PatientSex column.\n\nCould the hosts confirm whether PatientSex was intended to be included and was dropped during export, or whether the data description should be updated instead?\n\nNot a blocker either way — just flagging it early so nobody writes ingest code against a column that isn't there.\n\nThanks for putting together an interesting dataset.",
   "content": "<p>The Data page describes train.csv as containing StudyInstanceUID, PatientSex and Report alongside the twelve labels. The file itself has 14 columns: StudyInstanceUID, Report, and the 12 labels. There is no PatientSex column.</p>\n<p>Could the hosts confirm whether PatientSex was intended to be included and was dropped during export, or whether the data description should be updated instead?</p>\n<p>Not a blocker either way — just flagging it early so nobody writes ingest code against a column that isn't there.</p>\n<p>Thanks for putting together an interesting dataset.</p>",
